<section class="dv-turn" id="t26">
  <div class="dv-thd"><a class="dv-tid" href="#t26">26</a><span class="dv-tname">25c / 25f settled: what the Plates and Project tabs hold</span></div>
  <p class="dv-sub">Same structure as <span class="dv-oid">25c</span> and <span class="dv-oid">25f</span>: two tabs, the active plate open, other plates folded, project views open in the pane. Lo-fi, for content and behaviour. Each frame is annotated in three groups: <b>always visible</b>, <b>when relevant</b>, <b>on click</b>. Two small details have alternatives with a recommendation: the collapsed pane (<a class="dv-oid" href="#26g">26g</a>, recommend g1) and the customization mark (<a class="dv-oid" href="#26h">26h</a>, recommend h2). Not in the pane: model import, printer, nozzle and filament setup, Slice / Print, and move / rotate / scale.</p>
  <div class="dv-opts" style="margin-top:40px"><div class="dv-opt wide" id="26a"><div class="dv-olabel"><a class="dv-oid" href="#26a">26a</a><b>Ordinary two-plate job · Plates tab</b></div><div style="display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start"><div style="width:640px"><div class="dv-card"><div class="wf" style="width:640px;height:320px"><div class="hb"><span class="hm">‹ Home</span><span class="chip"><span>A1 mini · 0.4 ▾</span><span><i class="dot"></i>PLA Basic ▾</span></span><span class="job">Print plate 1 ▾</span></div><div class="bd"><div class="lp x"><div class="seg2" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 26px"><span class="on">Plates</span><span class="">Project</span><span style="color:#5f5a50">«<i class="mk">6</i></span></div><div class="r ph on">Plate 1<span class="dt" style="margin-left:6px">⋯</span><i class="mk">1</i><span class="st ok">Sliced</span></div><div class="r i1 sel"><span class="tp">▸</span>Bracket <span class="k">×2</span><i class="mk">2</i><span class="dt">⋯</span></div><div style="height:1.5px;background:#ddd8cd;margin:4px 0"></div><div class="r ph fold" style="padding-top:3px"><span>Plate 2<i class="mk">3</i><span class="st">Needs slice</span></span><span class="sum">Knob</span></div><div class="add">+ Add plate<i class="mk">4</i></div></div><div class="cv"><svg sc-camel-view-box="0 0 330 230"><polygon points="120,65 230,120 120,175 10,120" fill="#ebe6dc" stroke="#9a9486" stroke-width="1.5"></polygon><polygon points="350,65 460,120 350,175 240,120" fill="#efebe3" stroke="#cec8bb" stroke-width="1.2"></polygon><text x="50" y="170" font-size="11" fill="#8a8578" font-family="system-ui">1</text><text x="262" y="170" font-size="11" fill="#b4ae9f" font-family="system-ui">2</text><g transform="translate(84,100)"><polygon points="0,8 14,15 28,8 14,1" fill="#ece7dd" stroke="#8f897b"></polygon><polygon points="0,8 14,15 14,27 0,20" fill="#ded8cd" stroke="#8f897b"></polygon><polygon points="28,8 14,15 14,27 28,20" fill="#d0c9bd" stroke="#8f897b"></polygon><polygon points="-4,7 14,-3 32,7 32,21 14,31 -4,21" fill="none" stroke="#ec3013" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="3 2"></polygon></g><g transform="translate(124,114)"><polygon points="0,8 14,15 28,8 14,1" fill="#ece7dd" stroke="#8f897b"></polygon><polygon points="0,8 14,15 14,27 0,20" fill="#ded8cd" stroke="#8f897b"></polygon><polygon points="28,8 14,15 14,27 28,20" fill="#d0c9bd" stroke="#8f897b"></polygon><polygon points="-4,7 14,-3 32,7 32,21 14,31 -4,21" fill="none" stroke="#ec3013" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="3 2"></polygon></g><g transform="translate(296,112)" opacity=".6"><path d="M-14,0 v8 a14,7 0 0 0 28,0 v-8" fill="#d0c9bd" stroke="#8f897b"></path><ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="14" ry="7" fill="#ece7dd" stroke="#8f897b"></ellipse></g></svg><div class="tb"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="note" style="left:10px;top:8px;max-width:190px">⋯ shows on the hovered or selected row only</div></div><div class="cp"><div class="bx"><i></i><i style="width:70%"></i></div><i></i><i style="width:60%"></i><div class="in"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="width:440px"><div class="dv-card"><div class="cm"><div class="lg"><b>Always visible</b><span>The two tabs and « (collapse). Each plate row: name and Sliced / Needs slice. The active plate's objects: name and ×n. + Add plate under the last plate.</span><b>When relevant</b><span>A folded line per other plate (summary under the name). ▸ on an object with copies or parts. ⋯ on the hovered or selected row. Lock, ✎, swatches and Not on a plate: see <a class="dv-oid" href="#26b">26b</a>, <a class="dv-oid" href="#26c">26c</a>.</span><b>On click</b><span><i class="mk">1</i> plate row: becomes active, opens, the open plate folds; the 3D view frames it and the job button follows ("Print plate 1"). <i class="mk">2</i> object row: selects all its copies, toolbar appears; ▸ reveals the copies. <i class="mk">3</i> folded plate: same as <i class="mk">1</i>. <i class="mk">4</i> + Add plate: an empty plate, open and active. ⋯: the row menu (<a class="dv-oid" href="#26d">26d</a>). <i class="mk">6</i> «: collapses the pane (<a class="dv-oid" href="#26g">26g</a>). A click in the 3D view lights the matching row and opens its plate.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
  <div class="dv-opts" style="margin-top:40px"><div class="dv-opt wide" id="26b"><div class="dv-olabel"><a class="dv-oid" href="#26b">26b</a><b>A complex plate · copies, several filaments, a modifier</b></div><div style="display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start"><div style="width:640px"><div class="dv-card"><div class="wf" style="width:640px;height:380px"><div class="hb"><span class="hm">‹ Home</span><span class="chip"><span>A1 mini · 0.4 ▾</span><span><i class="dot"></i><i class="dot" style="background:#2b2b2b;border-color:#000"></i><i class="dot" style="background:#d9d4ca;border-color:#8f897b"></i>PLA Basic ▾</span></span><span class="job">Slice plate 1 ▾</span></div><div class="bd"><div class="lp x"><div class="seg2" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 26px"><span class="on">Plates</span><span class="">Project</span><span style="color:#5f5a50">«</span></div><div class="r ph on">Plate 1<span class="st">Needs slice</span></div>
