<section class="dv-turn" id="t26">
  <div class="dv-thd"><a class="dv-tid" href="#t26">26</a><span class="dv-tname">25c / 25f settled: what the Plates and Project tabs hold</span></div>
  <p class="dv-sub">Same structure as <span class="dv-oid">25c</span> and <span class="dv-oid">25f</span>: two tabs, the active plate open, other plates folded, project views open in the pane. Lo-fi, for content and behaviour. Each frame is annotated in three groups: <b>always visible</b>, <b>when relevant</b>, <b>on click</b>. Two small details have alternatives with a recommendation: the collapsed pane (<a class="dv-oid" href="#26g">26g</a>, recommend g1) and the customization mark (<a class="dv-oid" href="#26h">26h</a>, recommend h2). Not in the pane: model import, printer, nozzle and filament setup, Slice / Print, and move / rotate / scale.</p>
