="#8f897b"></polygon><polygon points="-4,7 14,-3 32,7 32,21 14,31 -4,21" fill="none" stroke="#ec3013" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="3 2"></polygon></g><g transform="translate(124,114)"><polygon points="0,8 14,15 28,8 14,1" fill="#ece7dd" stroke="#8f897b"></polygon><polygon points="0,8 14,15 14,27 0,20" fill="#ded8cd" stroke="#8f897b"></polygon><polygon points="28,8 14,15 14,27 28,20" fill="#d0c9bd" stroke="#8f897b"></polygon><polygon points="-4,7 14,-3 32,7 32,21 14,31 -4,21" fill="none" stroke="#ec3013" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="3 2"></polygon></g><g transform="translate(296,112)" opacity=".6"><path d="M-14,0 v8 a14,7 0 0 0 28,0 v-8" fill="#d0c9bd" stroke="#8f897b"></path><ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="14" ry="7" fill="#ece7dd" stroke="#8f897b"></ellipse></g></svg><div class="tb"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="note" style="left:10px;top:8px;max-width:190px">⋯ shows on the hovered or selected row only</div></div><div class="cp"><div class="bx"><i></i><i style="width:70%"></i></div><i></i><i style="width:60%"></i><div class="in"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="width:440px"><div class="dv-card"><div class="cm"><div class="lg"><b>Always visible</b><span>The two tabs and « (collapse). Each plate row: name and Sliced / Needs slice. The active plate's objects: name and ×n. + Add plate under the last plate.</span><b>When relevant</b><span>A folded line per other plate (summary under the name). ▸ on an object with copies or parts. ⋯ on the hovered or selected row. Lock, ✎, swatches and Not on a plate: see <a class="dv-oid" href="#26b">26b</a>, <a class="dv-oid" href="#26c">26c</a>.</span><b>On click</b><span><i class="mk">1</i> plate row: becomes active, opens, the open plate folds; the 3D view frames it and the job button follows ("Print plate 1"). <i class="mk">2</i> object row: selects all its copies, toolbar appears; ▸ reveals the copies. <i class="mk">3</i> folded plate: same as <i class="mk">1</i>. <i class="mk">4</i