<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px"><div class="scn" style="margin:0">h1 · one icon per kind (Orca today)</div><div class="dv-card"><div class="pane t" style="height:150px;position:relative"><div class="seg2" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 26px"><span class="on">Plates</span><span class="">Project</span><span style="color:#5f5a50">«</span></div><div class="r ph on">Plate 1<span class="st">Needs slice</span></div><div class="r i1">Case <span class="sw" style="background:#e8c93a">1</span><span style="display:flex;gap:2px;margin-left:auto"><svg width="10" height="10" sc-camel-view-box="0 0 10 10" style="flex:none"><path d="M1 9h8M2 9l3-7 3 7" fill="none" stroke="#6b6659"></path></svg><svg width="10" height="10" sc-camel-view-box="0 0 10 10" style="flex:none"><path d="M5 1C3 4 2 5.5 2 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 6 0C8 5.5 7 4 5 1z" fill="none" stroke="#6b6659"></path></svg><svg width="10" height="10" sc-camel-view-box="0 0 10 10" style="flex:none"><path d="M1 2h8M1 5h6M1 8h8" stroke="#6b6659"></path></svg><svg width="10" height="10" sc-camel-view-box="0 0 10 10" style="flex:none"><circle cx="5" cy="5" r="3" fill="none" stroke="#6b6659"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="5" r="1" fill="#6b6659"></circle></svg></span></div><div class="r i1">Hinge pin <span class="sw" style="background:#d9d4ca">3</span><span class="me" style="margin-left:auto">mesh errors</span></div></div></div></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px"><div class="scn" style="margin:0">h2 · one ✎ per row · recommended</div><div class="dv-card"><div class="pane t" style="height:150px;position:relative"><div class="seg2" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 26px"><span class="on">Plates</span><span class="">Project</span><span style="color:#5f5a50">«</span></div><div class="r ph on">Plate 1<span class="st">Needs slice</span></div><div class="r i1">Case <span class="sw" style="background:#e8c93a">1</span><span class="cz" style="margin-left:auto">✎</span></div><div class="mnu" style="left:60px;top:66px;width:136px;font-size:9.5px"><div>Support painting</div><div>Variable layer height</div><div>Per-object settings · 2</div></div><div class="r i1">Hinge pin <span class="sw" style="background:#d9d4ca">3</span><span class="me" style="margin-left:auto">mesh errors</span></div></div></div></div>
<div class="dv-card" style="width:380px"><div class="cm">
<div><span><b>h1</b> names each kind at a glance, but four icons on a 200 px row crowd the name and swatch, and people must learn the icons.</span></div>
<div><span><b>h2</b> says only "this object has customizations". Hover or click lists them by Orca's names; each line opens its tool or the settings. Same mark after a plate name for plate settings.</span></div>
<div><span>In both, a mesh problem is a red word, never the ✎ grey mark, so "you did this" and "the file has a problem" can't be confused.</span></div>
</div></div></div></div></div>
